---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import { site, whatsappUrl } from '../config/site';
import logoActive from '../assets/brand/infinicom-logo-active.svg';

const consultorUrl = whatsappUrl('Olá, quero falar com um consultor da INFINICOM.');
const phoneUrl = `tel:+${site.phoneNumber}`;
const socialLinks = [
  site.instagramUrl
    ? { label: 'Instagram', href: site.instagramUrl, icon: 'lucide:instagram' }
    : null,
  site.linkedinUrl
    ? { label: 'LinkedIn', href: site.linkedinUrl, icon: 'lucide:linkedin' }
    : null,
].filter((link): link is NonNullable<typeof link> => Boolean(link));
---

<footer id="contato" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-[#180024] text-[#f8f3fa]">
  <div class="container-shell py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_2fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex rounded-md focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
          aria-label="InfiniCom, página inicial"
        >
          <Image
            src={logoActive}
            alt="InfiniCom"
            width={128}
            class="h-auto w-32 object-contain brightness-0 invert"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-fuchsia-100/70">
          Consultoria comercial especializada em soluções Vivo para pessoas, empresas e empreendimentos em Minas Gerais.
        </p>
        <a
          class="mt-7 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-[#46005f] transition hover:bg-fuchsia-100 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
          href={consultorUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <Icon name="lucide:message-circle" class="size-4" />
          Falar com consultor
        </a>
      </div>

      <nav class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Navegação do rodapé">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Soluções</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-5 text-fuchsia-100/65">
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/para-sua-casa/">Para sua casa</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/para-sua-casa/vivo-fibra/">Vivo Fibra</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/para-sua-empresa/">Para sua empresa</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/para-sua-empresa/internet-empresarial/">Internet empresarial</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Empresa</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-5 text-fuchsia-100/65">
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/sobre/">Sobre a INFINICOM</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/conteudos/">Conteúdos</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/contato/">Contato</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/#faq">Dúvidas frequentes</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Atendimento</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-5 text-fuchsia-100/65">
            <li>
              <a class="inline-flex gap-2 transition hover:text-white" href={consultorUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
                <Icon name="lucide:message-circle" class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
                WhatsApp
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="inline-flex gap-2 transition hover:text-white" href={phoneUrl}>
                <Icon name="lucide:phone" class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
                {site.phoneDisplay}
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="inline-flex gap-2 break-all transition hover:text-white" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
                <Icon name="lucide:mail" class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
                {site.email}
              </a>
            </li>
            {site.serviceHours && (
              <li class="inline-flex gap-2">
                <Icon name="lucide:clock-3" class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
                <span>{site.serviceHours}</span>
              </li>
            )}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Legal</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-5 text-fuchsia-100/65">
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/privacidade/">Privacidade</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/cookies/">Cookies</a></li>
          </ul>

          {socialLinks.length > 0 && (
            <div class="mt-7">
              <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Redes sociais</h2>
              <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2">
                {socialLinks.map((link) => (
                  <a
                    class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-fuchsia-100/70 transition hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white"
                    href={link.href}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                    aria-label={link.label}
                  >
                    <Icon name={link.icon} class="size-4" />
                  </a>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          )}
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] sm:items-start sm:gap-5">
      <div class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-fuchsia-100/80">
        <Icon name="lucide:badge-check" class="size-4" />
        Informação institucional
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-xs leading-5 text-fuchsia-100/55">
        A INFINICOM realiza o atendimento comercial das soluções apresentadas neste site. Marcas de terceiros pertencem aos seus respectivos titulares.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pt-6 text-xs text-fuchsia-100/55 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} INFINICOM. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <p>
        Desenvolvido por
        <a
          href="https://ak7digitalhub.com.br/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-medium text-fuchsia-100/75 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-white hover:underline focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white"
        >
          AK7 DigitalHub
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
